            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A wall or ceiling panel assembly comprising:- at least a first panel (1) of a substantially rectangular or oblong shape, the panel having a front side and a back side and comprising:- at least a base layer (12) and a decorative layer (14), wherein the decorative layer (14) is applied on the side of the base layer (12) directed to the front side of the panel (1),- a tongue (100') on at least a first sidewall (10) of the panel,- a groove (102') in a sidewall (10) opposite to the first sidewall (10), said tongue (100') and said groove (102') being configured such that two of such panels can be coupled to each other in a plane of the first panel (1).wherein the wall or ceiling panel assembly further comprises at least a second panel (1') similar to the first panel (1), a tongue (100') of the second panel (1') being coupled with a groove (102') of the first panel (1), said tongue (100') being allowed to slide freely within said groove (102').</p>
